# 3. Business Context

We have a dedicated **DevOps Team** that works closely with Development teams to accelerate software delivery.

Development teams use CI/CD pipelines to build, test and deploy applications.

When a CI/CD pipeline fails, the current process is generally:

```text
Developer
   |
   v
CI/CD Pipeline Failure
   |
   v
Developer analyses failure
   |
   v
Developer raises Jira ticket to DevOps
   |
   v
DevOps investigates
   |
   v
DevOps identifies root cause
   |
   v
DevOps provides recommendation / resolution
```

This process is currently highly dependent on manual investigation.

The objective is to introduce an **AI-powered DevOps investigation capability** that can automatically analyse the Jira ticket and collect evidence from the enterprise DevOps ecosystem.

